      <div class="eyebrow">Electrical Engineering · B.Tech</div>
      <h1>Mahesh Dandhare<br>engineers <span class="accent">signal into safety.</span></h1>
      <div class="role-line" id="roleLine"></div>
      <p class="tagline">B.Tech Electrical Engineering student focused on <b>embedded systems</b> and <b>sensor integration</b> — turning raw hardware signals into real-world alerts using Arduino and Python.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('projects').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})"><span>View Project →</span></button>
        <button class="btn ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})"><span>Get in Touch</span></button>
