          <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-bar-fill"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-card reveal" style="--fill:85%">
          <div class="skill-num">05</div>
          <h3>Rapid Prototyping</h3>
          <p>Building working prototypes under hackathon time constraints, honed through BME and PPS hackathons.</p>
          <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-bar-fill"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-card reveal" style="--fill:80%">
          <div class="skill-num">06</div>
          <h3>Problem Solving</h3>
          <p>Structured programming logic and algorithmic problem-solving, sharpened at the PPS Hackathon.</p>
          <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-bar-fill"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
