          <div class="project-card featured">
            <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>IN PROGRESS</div>
            <h3>Alcohol Detection &amp; Alert System</h3>
            <p class="desc">A minor project built around a gas sensor and Arduino microcontroller that detects alcohol concentration in real time and triggers an immediate alert — aimed at flagging impaired states before they become a hazard, such as behind the wheel.</p>
            <div class="stack-row">
              <span class="stack-tag">Arduino</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Gas Sensor</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Alert Circuit</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Embedded C</span>
            </div>
            <svg class="flow-svg" viewBox="0 0 620 90" fill="none">
              <rect class="flow-box" x="0" y="28" width="130" height="36" rx="6"/>
              <text class="flow-label" x="65" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Sensor Input</text>
              <path class="flow-line" d="M130 46 H210" />
              <path class="flow-current a1" d="M130 46 H210" />
              <rect class="flow-box" x="210" y="28" width="130" height="36" rx="6"/>
              <text class="flow-label" x="275" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Arduino Logic</text>
              <path class="flow-line" d="M340 46 H420" />
