            <p class="desc">Built at the BME Hackathon — a capacitor-based sensing device designed to indicate lung-related readings, applying electrical engineering principles to a biomedical problem statement under competition time constraints.</p>
            <div class="stack-row">
              <span class="stack-tag">Capacitor Sensing</span>
